Description: read-only dpkg/apt package-state introspection for Runix
 Read-only introspection of installed package state (dpkg and apt) for the
 Runix framework, returning the shared Runix result model. Performs no
 mutations.
 .
 Experimental. Part of Runix (https://github.com/cornball-ai/runix).
